<title>GERMANY: RWE - telecoms deal talks with Veba, C&amp;W almost done.</title>
<headline>RWE - telecoms deal talks with Veba, C&amp;W almost done.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>German diversified energy group RWE AG said on Thursday that talks on a telecoms alliance with fellow German energy group Veba AG and the UK's Cable &amp; Wireless would soon be completed.</p>
<p>&quot;Discussions on the contract are almost complete,&quot; RWE management board chairman Dietmar Kuhnt told the group's annual general meeting in Essen.</p>
<p>At the same time, the groups would strengthen and expand in their core competencies in the sector, Kuhnt said.</p>
<p>When the alliance was announced at the beginning of the year, the forecast was that the contract would be signed by the end of the year.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
